BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    "Nine transforms eight's infinity into something deeper," observed the ancient tree. "Eight ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      revealed endless continuation. Nine reveals that continuation has no beginning either. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (       pattern didn't start in Season One-it was always here, waiting to be discovered.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
